        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/39ad0a1e36c7692d9ce4bdd7ac2fdf01.webp?t=1786673278\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/39ad0a1e36c7692d9ce4bdd7ac2fdf01.poster.webp?t=1786673278\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=370 /></picture></span><br>Questy Chess is a chess... RPG? puzzle? We're not sure, but it sure is, and isn't, regular Chess! Confused? You will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's set in a fictional home computer, it has classic chess moves. Chess right? Well, add power ups, health, an inventory and puzzle levels to traverse, and some tricky enemies and achievements, it's something else... isn't it?<br><br>Questy Chess was originally launched with Playdate to critical acclaim, as part of Playdate Season 1. Now experience it on PC, Mac or Steamdeck! A must for Chess heads &amp; lovers of minimal graphic design,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/723f98c39879906e11bc373a019f55e2.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/4c13b6467b07a4c4170a0da0386fdd00.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/0ce8dc10eeee2bc70133e565a682c95e.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/9df756ab1cb74edfc33384c9aecacfd7.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/39ad0a1e36c7692d9ce4bdd7ac2fdf01.webp?t=1786673278\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/39ad0a1e36c7692d9ce4bdd7ac2fdf01.poster.webp?t=1786673278\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=370 /></picture></span><br>Questy Chess is a chess... RPG? puzzle? We're not sure, but it sure is, and isn't, regular Chess! Confused? You will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's set in a fictional home computer, it has classic chess moves. Chess right? Well, add power ups, health, an inventory and puzzle levels to traverse, and some tricky enemies and achievements, it's something else... isn't it?<br><br>Questy Chess was originally launched with Playdate to critical acclaim, as part of Playdate Season 1. Now experience it on PC, Mac or Steamdeck! A must for Chess heads &amp; lovers of minimal graphic design,</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/723f98c39879906e11bc373a019f55e2.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/4c13b6467b07a4c4170a0da0386fdd00.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/0ce8dc10eeee2bc70133e565a682c95e.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562220/extras/9df756ab1cb74edfc33384c9aecacfd7.webp?t=1786673278\" width=512 height=32 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "A unique chess-RPG-puzzle hybrid set inside a corrupted 90s computer. Battle an evil chess invasion across 24 handcrafted levels, purge glitched worlds and bosses, and restore the system. Minimal Bauhaus visuals and a deep drone soundtrack shape a tense, atmospheric journey.",
        "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French, German, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese",
        "reviews": "“It's slow but quite compelling, with an unsettling atmosphere”<br />\r\nEDGE Magazine<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Questy Chess - weird, glitchy and brilliantly malevolent.”<br />\r\nEurogamer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Questy Chess is one of the coolest games, with super lo-fi aesthetics ... it's just such a delight.”<br />\r\nIGN<br />\r\n",
